  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "視覺策略與影像實務",
    "sub_ename": "VISUAL STRATEGY AND IMAGE PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在培養學生整合行銷策略與影像製作的能力，強調跨領域整合與實作。課程內容涵蓋影像企劃、拍攝、剪輯等實務技能，並結合品牌策略、創意思維與視覺傳達，提升學生在多元平台上傳遞品牌訊息的能力。透過團隊合作與專題製作，學生將實際操作影像專案，強化溝通協調與問題解決能力，為未來行銷與媒體產業的職涯發展奠定基礎。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to cultivate students' ability to integrate marketing strategies and image production, emphasizing cross-disciplinary integration and implementation. The course content covers practical skills such as video planning, shooting, and editing, and combines brand strategy, creative thinking, and visual communication to enhance students' ability to convey brand messages on multiple platforms. Through teamwork and project production, students will actually operate video projects, strengthen their communication, coordination and problem-solving skills, and lay the foundation for their future career development in the marketing and media industries.",
